    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1277640/extras/dbfe9b6a8d9c6a98cbadcedd93af1a2e.avif?t=1593375316\" /></div><br><strong>Pixel Fight</strong> is a multiplayer shooter game..<br><br>Team up with friends (or go solo if you prefer) and wield an impressive arsenal of weapons.<br>We've got lots of maps to try out, customisable outfits, badges to unlock, challenges to complete, and much more.<br><br>Oh and did we mention it's free?!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Create your own Lobby and Play with Friends (Private)<br></li><li>Join existing Lobbies to fight against players global<br></li><li>Many Weapons (and we add more!)<br></li><li>Characters with abilities<br></li><li>Special Items</li></ul>",
